# =====================================================================
# .NET / Visual Studio
# =====================================================================
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.idea/

# EF Core local cache / lock files
**/*.lscache
**/*.lock

# =====================================================================
# Secrets — NEVER commit. Local dev uses `dotnet user-secrets`
# (encrypted, lives in %APPDATA%\Microsoft\UserSecrets\<id>\secrets.json),
# production uses Azure App Service Configuration / Key Vault.
# =====================================================================
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/secrets.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# =====================================================================
# Node / Angular
# =====================================================================
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/coverage/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Angular env override for personal dev settings (e.g. custom API URL)
frontend/src/environments/environment.local.ts

# =====================================================================
# OS junk
# =====================================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# =====================================================================
# Logs
# =====================================================================
**/*.log
